(text
"BQ29209 internal balancing: TI Fig9 resistor network, about 10mA; matched cells required. Not a cell equalizer for mismatched/old cells.\nVC2 capacitor returns to VC1; VC1 capacitor returns to RAW B-. Do not return raw-domain nodes to system GND.\nCB_EN active LOW: 330k pull-up disables by default. Optocoupler needs /PG LOW AND Q607 enabled by raw pack UV comparator.\nRaw UV typical rising ~7.64V/falling ~7.53V; prevents balancing depleted cells. Optocoupler is domain translation, NOT patient isolation.\nOUT is an alarm test point only; primary charge/discharge cutoff is independently provided by S-8252AAY.\nJ401 sequence and external NTC wiring must be verified before cells are plugged in. No standalone charger firmware is needed."
